    "claim_boundary": "Frozen M8 MuJoCo audit inside the declared visual prior. The contact nuisance and F/T bias/noise/coupling/delay distributions are pre-hardware engineering priors, not measured iiwa statistics. Proposed+ and Proposed share a byte-identical conical fingerprint and frozen P1v3 output for each pose. No method receives the true center online; MuJoCo geometry is used only for offline success scoring. Baseline-B reset travel remains excluded by the frozen source audit. This can support a simulation mechanism claim, not a hardware robustness or cross-size claim.",
